# Design system

All UI must use components from `frontend/src/components/ui` and the color tokens in `frontend/src/index.css`. Never use raw hex colors or one-off button, table, or modal styles.

- Money always goes through `Money` or `formatMoney`.
- Status always goes through `StatusBadge` (icon plus text).
- Every async action uses `Button` with `loading`, which disables the control and blocks a second click.
- Every list shows `TableSkeleton` while loading and `EmptyState` when empty.
- Every destructive action uses `ConfirmDialog`.
- New pages go inside the app shell and appear in the sidebar only if the user has the permission.
- No mock or hardcoded business data.
